{
  "file_id": "3571",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 210,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "No!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17560,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "¡No!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "So defeating Myotismon wasn't\nenough?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17564,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¿No bastó con vencer\na Myotismon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "No way... so we'll still be\ntrapped here in the fog?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17601,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "No puede ser... ¿seguimos\natrapados en la niebla?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "An email? It's from Gennai.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17654,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Un email? Es de Gennai."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Rejoice, Chosen Children! I found\na hint about how to defeat\nMyotismon!",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17682,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "¡Alegraos, Niños Elegidos!\n¡Encontré una pista para\nderrotar a Myotismon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I found a poem in some ancient\nruins, with a prophecy.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17753,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Encontré un poema con una\nprofecía en unas ruinas."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "A flock of bats blotted out the\nsun.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17808,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Una bandada de murciélagos\ntapó el sol."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "The masses chanted the name of the\nundead Digimon king.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17845,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "Las masas coreaban el nombre del\nrey Digimon sempiterno."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "When the clock struck the number\nof the beast, the undead Digimon\nking revealed himself.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17901,
      "_bytes": 88,
      "translation": "Cuando el reloj marcó el número\nde la bestia, el rey Digimon\nsempiterno se reveló."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "The angels shot arrows of hope and\nlight into the loved ones of those\nthey were summoned to protect...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17990,
      "_bytes": 102,
      "translation": "Los ángeles lanzaron flechas de\nesperanza y luz sobre los seres\nqueridos de sus protegidos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "and a miracle happened. Anyway, I\nwish you luck.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18093,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "y ocurrió un milagro. En fin, os\ndeseo suerte."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "He said it was a hint, but it's\njust a load of gibberish. Doesn't\nhe know how to clear up this fog?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18142,
      "_bytes": 99,
      "translation": "Dijo que era una pista, pero es\nun galimatías. ¿Es que no sabe\ncómo despejar esta niebla?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Well...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18242,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Pues..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Tai, we should find Mom and Dad\nright now.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18250,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Tai, busquemos a mamá y papá\nahora mismo."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Let's get out of here for now...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18296,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Salgamos de aquí por ahora..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Mom! Open your eyes!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18329,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Mamá! ¡Abre los ojos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "You too, Dad!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18350,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Y tú, papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Mom!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18364,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Mamá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Papa! Mama!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18369,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Papá! ¡Mamá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I thought we'd only have to deal\nwith the fog, but now this...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18381,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Pensaba que solo era la niebla,\npero encima esto..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Their pulses are normal.",
      "speaker_id": 6271,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18444,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Su pulso es normal."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Are you Joe's brother?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18469,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Eres hermano de Joe?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Yeah, the Bakemon didn't find him\nbecause he was hiding in a closet.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18492,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "Sí, los Bakemon no lo encontraron\nporque se escondió en un armario."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Are you a doctor?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18561,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¿Eres médico?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'm still in medical school. But\nthere's no time for chit-chat, we \nneed to take care of these people.",
      "speaker_id": 6271,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18579,
      "_bytes": 102,
      "translation": "Aún estudio medicina. Pero no hay\ntiempo para charlar, hay que\natender a esta gente."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "It's my fault, isn't it...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18682,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "Es culpa mía, ¿verdad?..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's my fault, too...",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18709,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Es culpa mía también."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "It's okay. They're just sleeping.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18731,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Tranquila. Solo están dormidos."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "If you give them time, they'll\nwake up, right? Mom...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18765,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Si les dais tiempo, despertarán,\n¿verdad? Mamá..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "What did you want to talk with me\nabout?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18819,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿De qué querías hablar\nconmigo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "While we were hiding from the\nmonsters, your mom and I discussed\nthis, and we decided to tell you,",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18860,
      "_bytes": 98,
      "translation": "Mientras nos escondíamos de los\nmonstruos, tu madre y yo lo\nhablamos, y decidimos contarte:"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "The truth is, we're not your real\nparents.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18959,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "No somos tus padres de\nverdad."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I already knew.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19002,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Ya lo sabía."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I pretended I hadn't heard and\ntried to act the same as I had\nbefore.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19018,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "Fingí que no lo había oído\ne intenté seguir actuando\nigual que siempre."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "But in the end, I couldn't do it.\nSo I got absorbed in my computer\nto hide my true self.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19088,
      "_bytes": 88,
      "translation": "Pero al final no pude. Así que\nme refugié en el ordenador\npara ocultar cómo era."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "It's fine to be interested in\ncomputers!",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19177,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¡Está bien que te gusten\nlos ordenadores!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Dad...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19218,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Papá..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "It's fine for you to have your own\ninterests... but you really are\nexactly like your real father.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19225,
      "_bytes": 97,
      "translation": "Está bien que tengas tus propios\nintereses... pero te pareces\nmuchísimo a tu padre de verdad."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "My real father?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19323,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿Mi padre real?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "He was a distant relative and a\ngenius mathematician.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19339,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Era un pariente lejano y un\nmatemático genial."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Really?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19393,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Ah ¿sí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We were planning to tell you when\nyou grew up, but... I'm sorry.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19401,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Pensábamos decírtelo cuando\ncrecieras, pero... lo siento."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Thank you for telling me the\ntruth.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19466,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Gracias por contarme\nla verdad."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Ah, I mean... t-thanks.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19502,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Ah, digo... g-gracias."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "You don't have to force yourself.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19526,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "No tienes que forzarte."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Yes, all we want for you is to be\nhappy. We don't need any more than\nthat.",
      "speaker_id": 6161,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19560,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "Sí, solo queremos que seas\nfeliz. No necesitamos\nnada más que eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Izzy, just let those tears\nout! Don't worry 'bout havin' it\nall to yourself!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19635,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¡deja salir esas\nlágrimas! ¡No hace falta que\nlo lleves tú solo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "What's with all those bats?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19717,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué son esos murciélagos?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "They're covering the sky! And the\nsun!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19746,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Cubren el cielo! ¡Y también\nel sol!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "\"A flock of bats blotted out the\nsun...\"",
      "speaker_id": 6111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19785,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "\"Una bandada de murciélagos\ntapó el sol...\""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Heh heh heh. The true moment of\nterror is about to begin!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19826,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "Je je je. ¡El verdadero\nmomento de terror va a empezar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Sora! Your mom!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19884,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Sora! ¡Tu madre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19900,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡¿Eh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "speaker_id": 6141,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19906,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Amo Myotismoooooon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "What's wrong, Mom? Mom!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19926,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, mamá? ¡Mamá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "speaker_id": 6091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19950,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Amo Myotismoooooon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemoooooon!",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19970,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Amo Myotismoooooon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Stop it, Dad!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19990,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Para, papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Papa! Mama!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20004,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Papá! ¡Mamá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "W-what's..",
      "speaker_id": 6111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20016,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¿Q-qué es...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Um, there's something bothering\nme.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20027,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Oye, hay algo que me\npreocupa."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "The prophecy, right? \"The masses\nchanted the name of the undead\nDigimon king.\"",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20063,
      "_bytes": 78,
      "translation": "La profecía, ¿no? \"Las masas\ncoreaban el nombre del rey\nDigimon sempiterno.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "We saw bats, too. Just like the\nprophecy said.",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20142,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Vimos murciélagos, como\ndecía la profecía."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20189,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "What was the third part of the\nprophecy?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20196,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Cuál era la tercera parte\nde la profecía?"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "\"When the clock struck the number\nof the beast, the undead Digimon\nking revealed himself...\"",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20237,
      "_bytes": 92,
      "translation": "\"Cuando el reloj marcó el número\nde la bestia, el rey Digimon\nsempiterno se reveló...\""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "What's the \"number of the beast\"?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20330,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Qué es el \"número de la bestia\"?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "666. A number from the Book of\nRevelation.",
      "speaker_id": 6111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20364,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "666. Un número del libro del\nApocalipsis."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "666 would be... 6:06 and 6\nseconds? In that case, it's almost\ntime!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20407,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "666 sería... ¿las 6:06 y 6\nsegundos? ¡Entonces, está a punto\nde pasar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Is that... Myotismon?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20475,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Es eso... ¿Myotismon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "But he's so big...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20496,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Pero es enorme..."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Hahaha, looks like you're\nspeechless in front of Lord\nVenomMyotismon's form.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20515,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Jaja, parece que os ha dejado\nsin palabras la forma del\nAmo VenomMyotismon."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "VenomMyotismon?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20591,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿VenomMyotismon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Power... I need more power.",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20607,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Poder... necesito más poder."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "If you need food, I've secured it.\nCome, I'll lead you there!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20635,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "Si necesitas comida, ya la\ntengo. ¡Ven, te llevaré allí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "You're first!",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20697,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Tú primero!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "W-What are you doing?!\nAaaaaaaargh!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20711,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡¿Q-qué haces?!\n¡Aaaaaaaargh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "We won't let you eat everyone!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20747,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡No dejaremos que te comas a\ntodos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "We have to do something about\nthis!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20778,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Hay que hacer algo con\nesto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Garurumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20814,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Garurumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Got it, Matt!",
      "speaker_id": 2231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20825,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Vale, Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 2131,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20841,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Nothing's working!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20851,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Nada funciona!"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Aaaaaaargh!",
      "speaker_id": 2241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20870,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaargh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Gaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2141,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20882,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Gaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Agumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20894,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Gabumon! What's going on?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20902,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Gabumon! ¡¿Qué pasa?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "O powers of evil!",
      "speaker_id": 2731,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20929,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Poderes del mal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "We'll destroy you once again!",
      "speaker_id": 2841,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20947,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Te destruiremos otra vez!"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Haha... Hahahahahaha! You're\nsaying you're gonna destroy me?",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20977,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¡Jaja... Jajajajajaja! ¿Decís\nque vais a destruirme?"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Is that monster supposed to be a\nPerfect-level Digimon?",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21038,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¿Ese monstruo se supone que es\nCuerpo Perfecto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "I'll look into it!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21094,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Voy a investigar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Ultimate level?!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21113,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡¿Cuerpo Supremo?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "There's a level above Perfect?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21130,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡¿Hay un nivel por encima del\nCuerpo Perfecto?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Your attacks won't do anything!",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21162,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Vuestros ataques no sirven!"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Hang in there, Angemon!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21194,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Aguanta, Angemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Angewomon!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21218,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Angewomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "That's it! The rest of the\nprophecy!",
      "speaker_id": 6111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21229,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Eso es! ¡El resto de la\nprofecía!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "If Angemon and Angewomon are the\n\"angels\"...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21266,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Si Angemon y Angewomon son\nlos \"ángeles\"..."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "then who are \"those they were\nsummoned to protect\"?",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21311,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "entonces, ¿quiénes son \"sus\nprotegidos\"?"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "T.K and Kari! Now as for\n\"their loved ones\"...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21363,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¡T.K. y Kari! Y en cuanto a\n\"sus seres queridos\"..."
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "I'll do the explainin'. If I were\nan angel...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21415,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Ya te explico yo. Si yo fuera\nun ángel..."
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "...the person I'm protectin' would\nbe Izzy.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21461,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "...la persona que yo\nprotegería sería Izzy."
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "The people I love the most are my\nmom and dad. So Kari and\nT.K's loved ones...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21510,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "Los que más quiero son mi\nmadre y mi padre. Y los\nseres queridos de Kari y T.K..."
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Their family! Their parents and\nsiblings.",
      "speaker_id": 6151,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21594,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Su familia! Sus padres y\nhermanos."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "But why do we have to shoot arrows\ninto their loved ones?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21636,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "¿Pero por qué disparar flechas\na sus seres queridos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Well, Cupid fires arrows of love!",
      "speaker_id": 6161,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21694,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Cupido dispara flechas de amor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Right-o! Angemon and Angewomon can\nlet loose their arrows o' love.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21728,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "¡Vale! Angemon y Angewomon pueden\nlanzar flechas de amor."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "What do you think?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21795,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Qué opinas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "That must be it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21814,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Eso debe ser!"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "But if we do that...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21831,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Pero si eso pasa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "You and Tai might die.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21852,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Tú y Tai podríais morir."
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "We won't die!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21878,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡No moriremos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21892,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Then we'll use my light!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21898,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Usaremos mi luz!"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "And my hope! Shoot those arrows\ninto Matt and Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21923,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¡Y mi esperanza! ¡Disparad esas\nflechas a Matt y Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Believe in miracles!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21979,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Creed en el milagro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Are you scared?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22000,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿Tienes miedo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "I'm not scared ...well, actually,\nif I said that, I'd be lying.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22016,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "No tengo miedo... bueno, en\nrealidad, si dijera eso, mentiría."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Honestly, so am I. Hold onto me\ntight, so I won't run away.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22080,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "La verdad, yo también.\nAbrázame fuerte, no vaya a huir."
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "Got it. Do the same for me, too.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22140,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Vale. Haz lo mismo por mí."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Miracle!",
      "speaker_id": 2731,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22173,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Milagro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Awaken!",
      "speaker_id": 2841,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22182,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Surge!"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "Ultimate level! They evolved to\nUltimate-level Digimon!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22190,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¡Cuerpo Supremo! ¡Evolucionaron\na Digimon Cuerpo Supremo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Go, WarGreymon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22246,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Ve, WarGreymon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Whoa!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22262,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vaya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "I can still fight!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22268,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Aún puedo luchar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22287,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "Watch me, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22297,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Mírame, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Watch me, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22313,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Mírame, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Watch me, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22329,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Mírame, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Okay! Attack all at once!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22345,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Vale! Todos, ¡atacad ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "Gaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22371,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Gaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Heehee, I'll devour you all!",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22383,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Jiji, os devoraré a todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "What's that monster in his belly?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22412,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué monstruo hay en su vientre?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "It must be Myotismon's true form!\nLet's settle this once and for\nall!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22447,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Es la verdadera forma de\nMyotismon! ¡Acabemos ya\ncon esto para siempre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "Nghaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 3041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22516,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Nghaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Taiiiiiiiiii!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22529,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Taiiiiiiiiii!"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "We did it, Koromon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22546,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Ganamos, Koromon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "You did great too, Tsunomon!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22566,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Lo hiciste genial, Tsunomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Eheheh.",
      "speaker_id": 2211,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22595,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Ejeje."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "Huh? Who are you?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22603,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "I'm Plotmon. Nice to meet you.",
      "speaker_id": 2821,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22621,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Soy Salamon. Encantada."
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Agumon and Gabumon evolved to\nUltimate level, but they used up a\nlot of energy...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22652,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "Agumon y Gabumon llegaron a\nCuerpo Supremo, pero gastaron\nmucha energía..."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "And so did Tailmon. I guess that's\nwhy she returned to her Child\nform.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22734,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "Gatomon también. Supongo que por\neso volvió a su forma\nde Novato."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22805,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Eh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "T.Kuuuu!",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22812,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡¡T.K.!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Mama!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22824,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Mamá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "So you're safe. Thank goodness.",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22830,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Estás a salvo. Menos mal."
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Mom...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22862,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Mamá..."
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "You've gotten taller again,\nhaven't you?",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22869,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Has vuelto a crecer,\n¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Yeah, a little.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22910,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Sí, un poco."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "It's been a while.",
      "speaker_id": 6111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22926,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Cuánto tiempo."
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "Yes, it has...",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22945,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Sí, mucho..."
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "It's been a long time since we've\ngot the whole family together,\nhasn't it, Matt?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22960,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "Hace mucho que no estamos toda\nla familia junta, ¿verdad,\nMatt?"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "Yeah. You're right...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23044,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Sí. Tienes razón..."
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "I wonder if my parents are okay...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23066,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Ojalá mis padres estén bien..."
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "That's Shin!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23101,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Es Shin!"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "Everyone's families are safe!\nThey're back to normal!",
      "speaker_id": 6271,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23114,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Todas las familias están\na salvo! ¡Han vuelto a la normalidad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Thank goodness!",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23168,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Menos mal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "Isn't that great, Sora?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23184,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿No es genial, Sora?"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Y...yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23208,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡S...sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Hey, look! The fog's clearing up.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23218,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Mirad! La niebla se despeja."
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23252,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "No way...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23263,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "No puede ser..."
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "Tai, I'm scared...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23273,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Tai, tengo miedo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "W...what's this?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23295,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Q...qué es esto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "So that must be it...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23312,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Entonces es eso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "So what must be it?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23334,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¿Qué será eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "That continent is the Digimon\nworld.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23354,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Ese continente es el\nDigimundo."
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23391,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "It does kind of look like it, now\nthat you mention it.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23398,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Pues sí, ahora que lo dices,\nse parece bastante."
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "That's the world Plotmon came\nfrom...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23453,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Ese es el mundo de donde\nviene Salamon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "No, that's not the Digimon world\nwe were in anymore...",
      "speaker_id": 2821,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23491,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "No, ese ya no es el Digimundo\nen el que estuvimos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "You're right. It's already been a\nfew days since we came here...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23546,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Tienes razón. Ya han pasado\nunos días desde que llegamos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "which means many years have passed\nin the Digimon world.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23611,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "y han pasado muchos años\nen el Digimundo."
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "We came here without fixing the\ndistortions in the Digimon\nworld...",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23668,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Vinimos sin arreglar las\ndistorsiones del Digimundo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "so has something really bad\nhappened on the other side?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23736,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¿Habrá pasado entonces algo\nmuy malo al otro lado?"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "And could that have affected our\nworld?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23792,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¿Y podría haber afectado a\nnuestro mundo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "Let's go check it out. Let's go\nback to the Digimon world!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23832,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Vamos a comprobarlo. ¡Volvamos\nal Digimundo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "But how do we get back?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23891,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Pero cómo volvemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "The first time we went to the\nDigimon world, we were brought\nthere by the Digivices...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23915,
      "_bytes": 86,
      "translation": "La primera vez que fuimos al\nDigimundo, nos llevaron los\nDigivices..."
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "So they should work this time,\ntoo!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24002,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡También deberían funcionar\nahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "Yeah! We might as well try!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24038,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Podemos intentarlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "All right! Everyone, put your\nDigivices together!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24066,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Vale! Todos, ¡juntad\nvuestros Digivices!"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "Please! Take us back to the\nDigimon world!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24116,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¡Por favor! ¡Llevadnos de\nvuelta al Digimundo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "If we ride this light, we can go\nback to the Digimon world.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24159,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Si montamos en esta luz,\npodemos volver al Digimundo."
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "Yeah, we can take this back!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24219,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Sí, esto nos puede llevar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24248,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "english": "Sorry to do this just when\neveryone gathered here, but we'll \nbe leaving for a bit!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24256,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "¡Siento hacer esto justo cuando\nnos hemos reunido todos, pero\nnos vamos un momento!"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "english": "At this rate, Earth will be done\nfor! So I'll protect you, Mom, and\nthe others!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24340,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "¡Si sigue así, la Tierra está\nperdida! ¡Os protegeré a ti, mamá,\ny a los demás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "english": "T.K... Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 6221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24420,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "T.K... Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "english": "We're counting on you, everyone.",
      "speaker_id": 6271,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24440,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Contamos con vosotros, chicos."
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "english": "I believe in Izzy and the\nothers.",
      "speaker_id": 6161,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24473,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "Confío en Izzy y en los\ndemás."
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "english": "All right, we're off!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24512,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Vale, nos vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
